  55:../Libraries/XMCLib/src/xmc1_scu.c ****  *
  56:../Libraries/XMCLib/src/xmc1_scu.c ****  * @brief SCU low level driver API prototype definition for XMC1 family of microcontrollers <br>
  57:../Libraries/XMCLib/src/xmc1_scu.c ****  *
  58:../Libraries/XMCLib/src/xmc1_scu.c ****  * <b>Detailed description of file</b> <br>
  59:../Libraries/XMCLib/src/xmc1_scu.c ****  * APIs provided in this file cover the following functional blocks of SCU: <br>
  60:../Libraries/XMCLib/src/xmc1_scu.c ****  * -- GCU (APIs prefixed with XMC_SCU_GEN_) <br>
  61:../Libraries/XMCLib/src/xmc1_scu.c ****  * ----Temperature Monitoring, Voltage Monitoring, CCU Start etc
  62:../Libraries/XMCLib/src/xmc1_scu.c ****  *
  63:../Libraries/XMCLib/src/xmc1_scu.c ****  * -- CCU (APIs prefixed with XMC_SCU_CLOCK_)<br>
  64:../Libraries/XMCLib/src/xmc1_scu.c ****  * ---- Clock initialization, Clock Gating, Sleep Management etc
  65:../Libraries/XMCLib/src/xmc1_scu.c ****  *
  66:../Libraries/XMCLib/src/xmc1_scu.c ****  * -- RCU (APIs prefixed with XMC_SCU_RESET_) <br>
  67:../Libraries/XMCLib/src/xmc1_scu.c ****  * ---- Reset Init, Cause, Manual Reset Assert/Deassert etc
  68:../Libraries/XMCLib/src/xmc1_scu.c ****  *
  69:../Libraries/XMCLib/src/xmc1_scu.c ****  * -- INTERRUPT (APIs prefixed with XMC_SCU_INTERRUPT_)<br>
  70:../Libraries/XMCLib/src/xmc1_scu.c ****  * ---- Initialization, Manual Assert/Deassert, Acknowledge etc
  71:../Libraries/XMCLib/src/xmc1_scu.c ****  *
  72:../Libraries/XMCLib/src/xmc1_scu.c ****  */
  73:../Libraries/XMCLib/src/xmc1_scu.c **** 
